alence-equivalent" title="equivalent">is equivalent to</a></td><td>257622000 (Healthcare facility)</td></tr><tr><td>Public-Hospital</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent" title="equivalent">is equivalent to</a></td><td>276052003 (Public facilities)</td></tr><tr><td>Private-Hospital</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent" title="equivalent">is equivalent to</a></td><td>309895006 (Private hospital)</td></tr><tr><td>NBO-FBO-Hospital (NBO/FBO hospital)</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent" title="equivalent">is equivalent to</a></td><td>394794000 (Health clinic managed by voluntary or private agents)</td></tr><tr><td>Private-Clinic</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent" title="equivalent">is equivalent to</a></td><td>185483006 (Outreach clinic)</td></tr><tr><td>Self-referred</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent" title="equivalent">is equivalent to</a></td><td>1991000124105 (Referred by self)</td></tr><tr><td>Community-Referred</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent" title="equivalent">is equivalent to</a></td><td>310391008 (Community clinic)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 4 </b>Mapping from <a href="CodeSystem-ng-hiv-target-population-category-cs.html">Target Population Category Codes</a> to <a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-snomedct.html">SNOMED CT (all versions)</a></p><table class="grid"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>MSM</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent"